{% comment %}
  Markdown CV layout.

  Unlike the theme's structured `cv` layout (which renders _data/cv or a
  resume, and ignores the page body), this keeps the page's own Markdown and
  only adds a wrapper, so _sass/_cv.scss can apply CV-only table rules —
  notably horizontal scrolling for the wide tables on small screens —
  without affecting tables on any other page.
{% endcomment %}
<div class="cv-page">
  {{ content }}
</div>
